abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational research package for geometry-dependent equilibrium
  radii in a generalized inverse-power repulsive/stabilizing force model, including
  polygon spectra, Platonic solids, controlled cuboid deformation, analytic large-N limits, rigorous geometry bounds, and boundary audits. Mixed licensing: code under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; manuscript/figures/documentation under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
